1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,650
Yamal scored nine goals in September. But that
is only half the story.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,650
Barcelona says he also added seven assists.
Sixteen goal contributions in one month.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,825
Here is the detail that matters: he delivered
at least two goal contributions in every

4
00:00:12,825 --> 00:00:15,650
Barcelona appearance.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,650
Five games. Six goals, six assists. So the
story goes beyond one spectacular performance.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,825
Then he carried it into the international
break, scoring against England and twice

7
00:00:25,825 --> 00:00:28,650
against Croatia.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,650
According to Barcelona, this was his most
productive month yet for goals and assists.

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,650
My takeaway? Judge him as a finisher and a
creator. The assists change the picture.

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,650
What matters more when you judge a winger:
scoring goals, or creating them?
